# Experimentation

An experiment record includes id, dataset, model, prompt hash, seed, hardware, command, and outcome. Use `src/hegemon/telemetry/record.py`.

Promote a challenger only when `promote()` would return `promoted`: same task count, measured solve rate, no regression. Keep the previous champion config for rollback.

Synthetic fixture recall is not a Kaggle score. Write that distinction in the result file.
